@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = <access token of an admin with broadcasts permissions>

### Broadcast history (filters: status, audience, channel, search, from, to, page, limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts?status=scheduled&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Who would a broadcast to drivers reach, per channel
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts/audience-preview?audience=drivers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SMS units left on the provider account (a broadcast costs about reachable.sms x smsSegments)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts/sms-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Draft a broadcast (always a draft; then send or schedule it)
# @name draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Accra-Tema route diversion on Monday",
  "body": "Because of road works on the motorway, Monday's morning commutes between Accra and Tema will use the Spintex Road. Expect pickups up to 10 minutes later than usual.",
  "smsText": "Nframa: Mon commutes Accra-Tema use Spintex Rd due to road works. Pickups up to 10 min later.",
  "audience": "drivers",
  "channels": ["inApp", "push", "sms"]
}

### One broadcast
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts/{{draft.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit it (draft or scheduled only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts/{{draft.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audience": "all"
}

### Schedule it (or move a scheduled one): 1 minute to 90 days ahead, with a timezone
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts/{{draft.response.body.data.id}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledFor": "2026-10-12T05:30:00Z"
}

### Cancel it (scheduled only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts/{{draft.response.body.data.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a draft (expect 409 for anything else)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts/{{draft.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
